{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat your friends in 'SHARKS' a cross-platform (PC and VR) multiplayer hunting game. Hunt with groups of up to 10 players online. Eat whatever you can to survive and avoid the zombie sharks: last player standing wins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/Sharks_Attack.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VR controls are super responsive (it feels like a human-shark mind meld): simply look where you want the shark to swim. Pull the trigger to move forward, press the grip button to chomp/eat things. You can also play on a flat-screen using mouse/keyboard or gamepad. Each game is a quick snack-sized round so it's perfect to just drop-in or drop-out whenever you've got a spare minute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/SharkJetPack.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your shark with a huge range of unlockable cosmetics. Mix and match items you've unlocked from your inventory to get the look you want.<i> Who would have thought sharks could be so cute?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/NewLook.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no pay-to-win so everyone is on equal terms....and if you get tired of eating each other, there are plenty of other things to chomp on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/SharksTyres.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What are you waiting for? Get your friends to download SHARKS for free and start eating each other today!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/SharkEatsCrab.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2315970?t=1744614409","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744614409","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/9f6a82b587e22cb7846ad814f9785a1d6ae95ef6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744614409","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/9f6a82b587e22cb7846ad814f9785a1d6ae95ef6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744614409","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The shark can attack and eat other sharks and sea creatures with depictions of blood and gore"},"demos":[{"appid":2440150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat your friends in 'SHARKS' a cross-platform (PC and VR) multiplayer hunting game. Hunt with groups of up to 10 players online. Eat whatever you can to survive and avoid the zombie sharks: last player standing wins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2315970/extras/Sharks_Attack.gif?t=1744614409\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The VR controls are super responsive (it feels like a human-shark mind meld): simply look where you want the shark t